# KMediaVlc license map

Copyright (c) 2026 Shusek

The project-authored Java API and loader sources in
`runtime-desktop/src/main/java/**` and `runtime-android/src/main/java/**`,
and their compiled forms, are offered at the recipient's choice under
`MIT OR LGPL-2.1-or-later`.
The additional MIT offer covers that project-authored Java code first
conveyed in 0.1.0-rc.15 and later. Existing LGPL permissions remain available.
The complete texts are `LICENSES/MIT-KMediaVlc-Java.txt` and
`LICENSES/LGPL-2.1.txt`.

This permits compiling that Java layer into an independent proprietary
GraalVM Native Image or optimized Android DEX. It does not grant a permissive license to any native
library, JNI bridge, VLC implementation, plugin, contrib, or third-party code.
Those works retain their own licenses, source and replacement obligations.

Other project-authored files marked LGPL-2.1-or-later remain under LGPL.
The stable client header retains ISC. The Gradle wrapper retains Apache-2.0.
See NOTICE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and each file's SPDX identifier.
